The files in this directory are synthetic demonstration inputs for the
atrium-keyword-extract skill. They describe a fictitious excavation and contain
no archival data:

  report.txt            eight lines of Czech text on two pages
  report.document.json  the same text as an ATRIUM document record, written by
                        atrium-digital-convert (v1.2.1-beta) from a DOCX made
                        for this sample

